+/// Whether a CPU patch can apply on this CPU: the SSE4a ones without SSE4a, the reciprocal ones on
+/// an Intel CPU. Without one, the static pass has nothing to patch: only the FS accesses remain, and
+/// the ahead-of-time pass patches those. (GameFlex: that pass took 108 s for Final Fantasy VII
+/// Remake under Box64 on a phone, for nothing, once Box64 reported an AMD CPU with SSE4a.)
+bool CpuPatchesCanApply() noexcept;
+
 } // namespace Core
